{"id":"pictures-of-the-floating-world","title":"Pictures of the Floating World","author":"Amy Lowell","year":"1919","note":"Imagist flashes and Japanese-inflected miniatures — how little language tilts a room.","minutes":456,"cover":"","coverAlt":"","scenes":[{"id":"s0","title":"Chapter 1","place":"Chapter 1","reentry":"LACQUER PRINTS","prompt":"What image stays?"}],"breaths":[{"id":"s0-0","sceneId":"s0","text":"LACQUER PRINTS"},{"id":"s0-1","sceneId":"s0","text":"STREETS"},{"id":"s0-2","sceneId":"s0","text":"(Adapted from the poet Yakura Sangin, 1769)"},{"id":"s0-3","sceneId":"s0","text":"As I wandered through the eight hundred and eight"},{"id":"s0-4","sceneId":"s0","text":"streets of the city,"},{"id":"s0-5","sceneId":"s0","text":"I saw nothing so beautiful"},{"id":"s0-6","sceneId":"s0","text":"As the Women of the Green Houses,"},{"id":"s0-7","sceneId":"s0","text":"With their girdles of spun gold,"},{"id":"s0-8","sceneId":"s0","text":"And their long-sleeved dresses,"},{"id":"s0-9","sceneId":"s0","text":"Coloured like the graining of wood."},{"id":"s0-10","sceneId":"s0","text":"As they walk,"},{"id":"s0-11","sceneId":"s0","text":"The hemsof their outer garments flutter open,"},{"id":"s0-12","sceneId":"s0","text":"And the blood-red linings glow like sharp-toothed"},{"id":"s0-13","sceneId":"s0","text":"maple leaves"},{"id":"s0-14","sceneId":"s0","text":"In Autumn."},{"id":"s0-15","sceneId":"s0","text":"By MEssENGER"},{"id":"s0-16","sceneId":"s0","text":"OnE night"},{"id":"s0-17","sceneId":"s0","text":"When there was a clear moon,"},{"id":"s0-18","sceneId":"s0","text":"I sat down"},{"id":"s0-19","sceneId":"s0","text":"To write a poem"},{"id":"s0-20","sceneId":"s0","text":"About maple-trees."},{"id":"s0-21","sceneId":"s0","text":"But the dazzle of moonlight"},{"id":"s0-22","sceneId":"s0","text":"In the ink"},{"id":"s0-23","sceneId":"s0","text":"Blinded me,"},{"id":"s0-24","sceneId":"s0","text":"And I could only write"},{"id":"s0-25","sceneId":"s0","text":"What I remembered."},{"id":"s0-26","sceneId":"s0","text":"Therefore, on the wrapping of my poem"},{"id":"s0-27","sceneId":"s0","text":"T have inscribed your name."},{"id":"s0-28","sceneId":"s0","text":"CIRCUMSTANCE"},{"id":"s0-29","sceneId":"s0","text":"Upon the maple leaves"},{"id":"s0-30","sceneId":"s0","text":"The dew shines red,"},{"id":"s0-31","sceneId":"s0","text":"But on the lotus blossom"},{"id":"s0-32","sceneId":"s0","text":"It has the pale transparence of tears."},{"id":"s0-33","sceneId":"s0","text":"PICTURES   OF    THE   FLOATING   WORLD       5"},{"id":"s0-34","sceneId":"s0","text":"ANGLES"},{"id":"s0-35","sceneId":"s0","text":"THE rain is dark against the white sky,"},{"id":"s0-36","sceneId":"s0","text":"Or white against the foliage of eucalyptus-trees."},{"id":"s0-37","sceneId":"s0","text":"But, in the cistern, it is a sheet of mauve and amber,"},{"id":"s0-38","sceneId":"s0","text":"Because of the chrysanthemums"},{"id":"s0-39","sceneId":"s0","text":"Heaped about its edge."},{"id":"s0-40","sceneId":"s0","text":"VicaRIOUS"},{"id":"s0-41","sceneId":"s0","text":"WueEn I stand under the willow-tree"},{"id":"s0-42","sceneId":"s0","text":"Above the river,"},{"id":"s0-43","sceneId":"s0","text":"In my straw-coloured silken garment"},{"id":"s0-44","sceneId":"s0","text":"Embroidered with purple chrysanthemums,            ,"},{"id":"s0-45","sceneId":"s0","text":"It is not at the bright water"},{"id":"s0-46","sceneId":"s0","text":"That I am gazing,"},{"id":"s0-47","sceneId":"s0","text":"But at your portrait,"},{"id":"s0-48","sceneId":"s0","text":"Which I have caused to be painted"},{"id":"s0-49","sceneId":"s0","text":"On my fan."},{"id":"s0-50","sceneId":"s0","text":"Negar Kioto"},{"id":"s0-51","sceneId":"s0","text":"As I crossed over the bridge of Ariwarano Narikira,"},{"id":"s0-52","sceneId":"s0","text":"I saw that the waters were purple"},{"id":"s0-53","sceneId":"s0","text":"With the floating leaves of maples."},{"id":"s0-54","sceneId":"s0","text":"DESOLATION"},{"id":"s0-55","sceneId":"s0","text":"Unpver the plum-blossoms are nightingales ;"},{"id":"s0-56","sceneId":"s0","text":"But the sea is hidden in an egg-white mist,"},{"id":"s0-57","sceneId":"s0","text":"And they are silent."},{"id":"s0-58","sceneId":"s0","text":"YosHIwaRA       LAMENT"},{"id":"s0-59","sceneId":"s0","text":"GOLDEN peacocks"},{"id":"s0-60","sceneId":"s0","text":"Under blossoming cherry-trees,"},{"id":"s0-61","sceneId":"s0","text":"But on all the wide sea"},{"id":"s0-62","sceneId":"s0","text":"There is no boat."},{"id":"s0-63","sceneId":"s0","text":"SUNSHINE"},{"id":"s0-64","sceneId":"s0","text":"THE pool is edged with the blade-like leaves of irises."},{"id":"s0-65","sceneId":"s0","text":"If I throw a stone into the placid water,"},{"id":"s0-66","sceneId":"s0","text":"PICTURES      OF THE FLOATING   WORLD        7"},{"id":"s0-67","sceneId":"s0","text":"It suddenly stiffens"},{"id":"s0-68","sceneId":"s0","text":"Into rings and rings"},{"id":"s0-69","sceneId":"s0","text":"Of sharp gold wire."},{"id":"s0-70","sceneId":"s0","text":"ILLUSION"},{"id":"s0-71","sceneId":"s0","text":"WALKING beside the tree-peonies,"},{"id":"s0-72","sceneId":"s0","text":"I saw a beetle"},{"id":"s0-73","sceneId":"s0","text":"Whose wings were of black lacquer spotted with milk."},{"id":"s0-74","sceneId":"s0","text":"I would have caught it,"},{"id":"s0-75","sceneId":"s0","text":"But it ran from me swiftly"},{"id":"s0-76","sceneId":"s0","text":"And hid under the stone lotus"},{"id":"s0-77","sceneId":"s0","text":"Which supports the statue of Buddha."},{"id":"s0-78","sceneId":"s0","text":"A YxEAR PassEs"},{"id":"s0-79","sceneId":"s0","text":"Bryonp the porcelain fence of the pleasure garden,"},{"id":"s0-80","sceneId":"s0","text":"I hear the frogs in the blue-green rice-fields;   |"},{"id":"s0-81","sceneId":"s0","text":"But the sword-shaped moon"},{"id":"s0-82","sceneId":"s0","text":"Has cut my heart in two."},{"id":"s0-83","sceneId":"s0","text":"A Lover"},{"id":"s0-84","sceneId":"s0","text":"Ir I could catch the green lantern of the firefly"},{"id":"s0-85","sceneId":"s0","text":"I could see to write you a letter."},{"id":"s0-86","sceneId":"s0","text":"To a Huspanp"},{"id":"s0-87","sceneId":"s0","text":"BricuHTer than fireflies upon the Uji River"},{"id":"s0-88","sceneId":"s0","text":"Are your words in the dark, Beloved."},{"id":"s0-89","sceneId":"s0","text":"Tue FisHERMAN’s WIFE"},{"id":"s0-90","sceneId":"s0","text":"WuHENn I am alone,"},{"id":"s0-91","sceneId":"s0","text":"The wind in the pine-trees"},{"id":"s0-92","sceneId":"s0","text":"Is like the shuffling of waves"},{"id":"s0-93","sceneId":"s0","text":"Upon the wooden sides of a boat."},{"id":"s0-94","sceneId":"s0","text":"From       CHINA"},{"id":"s0-95","sceneId":"s0","text":"I rHouGutT: —"}]}